{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d521c06cc71d8f8cb17b1671756ebd5b1f2977f5d1e84f17cc12eafd320901d7", "ja": "（ロコとこのみさんが出演したPV撮影が終了した。\nアートをテーマにした妖艶で不思議な内容だった……）", "zh": "（ROCO和这个美小姐出演的PV拍摄结束了。\n这是以艺术为主题、妖艳而神秘的内容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1001_p", "source_sha256": "82f6523fe443da9c04dd4c8fed5782765e1a5a607e03a5f0a1ecf185792a8a02", "ja": "ロコ、お疲れさま。撮影バッチリだったな！\n監督さんも、いい映像が撮れたって喜んでたよ。", "zh": "ROCO，辛苦了。拍摄非常顺利！\n导演也很高兴，说拍到了很棒的影像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "d1497b9a273395af6ce5e0a5a9bc5a89f9bd796ca360c0f7c2b83bf11101909a", "ja": "サンクスです、{$P$}♪　まさか、\nロコがアートになるとは思いませんでしたけど……。", "zh": "谢谢啦，{$P$}♪　没想到ROCO也能成为艺术，\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "98c8c353dbd12e1ded5dd640830758ce1409a3f7607d1cc6a6f13660785a8e86", "ja": "フレッシュなエクスペリエンスができてよかったです♪\nロコのインスピレーションも、刺激されました！", "zh": "能有一次新鲜的体验真是太好了♪  \nROCO的灵感也受到了激发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e3ddd64a9d1d3c7f41d876bda74219281e7f2bf6ea38431289da09c63099fb3a", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。ロコも、難しい役どころだったな。\n芸術家が描く理想の少女の役……。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。ROCO也演了个难度不小的角色啊。艺术家笔下理想少女的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1005_p", "source_sha256": "83a9cc8f35662fdee0b71a57a93224d29d82b138636215512fa27e0211738a07", "ja": "話を聞いた時は少し驚いたけど。\nでもロコに任せて、正解だったみたいだな。", "zh": "听到这个角色的时候，我还是有点惊讶的。\n不过看来把它交给ROCO，是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "420a3a42c7d30e040e5b7ca1397c098213598ad8df698893f7706239e80dc12c", "ja": "えへへ～♪　……あっ、{$P$}！\nコノミがどこに行ったか知りませんか？", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪……啊，{$P$}！\n您知道好美去哪儿了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef09f5fba519934dee0459887d4614e80095c40d9f2dff9066ea0ef44f3d79d9", "ja": "撮影がスムーズにいったのは、コノミのおかげです。\nだから、お礼を言いたくて……。", "zh": "拍摄能顺利进行，多亏了可妮米。\n所以我想向她道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e27edc14c9894b66e590a986ba25db67609f0078a8a46e632a1662fd6284091b", "ja": "このみさんなら楽屋に戻ったよ。\nそういえば、ふたりとも休憩中はずっと話をしてたな。", "zh": "要是找这个美的话，她已经回休息室了。\n说起来，你们两个人休息的时候一直在聊天呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "34b51c8be3bc8f88a193a795b4d3e7f6a96b8106e16466e21d743085b7d99424", "ja": "はい！　コノミにアドバイスをもらってたんです。\nえっと……その、距離が近かったので……。", "zh": "是的！刚才在向木乃美请教。\n那个……因为我们离得比较近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a46f87f5674c9701816f64f99aed5e6bf88e5e3d41d5b61ef8efaf27aa01ecc6", "ja": "距離……？\nああ。後半はふたりが近づくシーンが多かったな。", "zh": "距离……？\n啊，后半段确实有很多两个人逐渐靠近的场景啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "8b7a2cfe3ba151524e24c8298158e90b33f09c5a7d3a2fa59686a48c7be481b6", "ja": "はい……。シーンによっては、密着したり……。\nか、顔が、すごく近づくこともありました……。", "zh": "是的……有些场景里，还会紧紧贴在一起……\n有、有时候脸也会靠得非常近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "1786675660c36e6611cbbb23d2e38fcacb8ec64648cb13c92f6d0bc70e6d26a8", "ja": "でもコノミが「私をセクシーなアートだと思って」\nって、言ってくれたんです！", "zh": "不过，好美对我说：“把我想成性感的艺术！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1013_p", "source_sha256": "56b08a91df33097e651993477e20c5ebd7f2f44aece33352466026d105ac8a21", "ja": "このみさんが、セクシーなアート？", "zh": "可奈小姐是性感的艺术？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "53b03cd422339625fe4ad0fd938dd0d9d90ffd4e6aef7f557010c3c8f75272fc", "ja": "はい！　本番中も、目の前にいるコノミを\nアートだと思ったら……ドキドキしなくなりました！", "zh": "是的！演出过程中，只要把眼前的小此木看成一件艺术品……就不会紧张了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "cef01e8b4b4d07f52e1807fb87e47ad6d47ee71cc76adc469a5e4878d903f692", "ja": "セクシーというよりはキュートで……あっ！\nい、今のはコノミにシークレットでお願いしますね。", "zh": "与其说是性感，不如说是可爱……啊！\n刚、刚才那些请对好美保密哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c8a6fa14d13d805676ebe1a750ea968e2427ae08fd24cfc4fd99d90b4e70168e", "ja": "ははっ、わかったよ。でもロコらしい解決法を\n提案するなんて。このみさんは、よくみてるな。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。不过，居然能提出这么有ROCO风格的解决办法，木实小姐还真是观察得很仔细啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "9986b8c70525f20961f0762ef49c0331fa0c2b6d774312aaf913bc1868404f6d", "ja": "そうですね。コノミは、パーフェクトなレディーです。\nウォッチしてると、とてもビューティーで……。", "zh": "是啊。木实是一位完美的淑女。看着她时，实在太美了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "53a8a2dfe29b5ceb142167787152b6dd6cea2a80a24fb39f1149ef866d9ef6e6", "ja": "撮影の時も、本物のアートに見える瞬間があって……。\nロコも、時々見惚れてしまいました。", "zh": "拍摄时，也有一些瞬间看起来就像真正的艺术品……就连ROCO也会时不时看得入迷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3d094e52c9a504cb689e8de688fea1c66806e1fac5fc584839a8dd05c9a593d2", "ja": "そんなことが……。監督さんがロコの表情を\n褒めてたけど。それも理由のひとつかもしれないな。", "zh": "居然还有这种事……导演夸过ROCO的表情。那或许也是原因之一吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "0c74c8e7788b8df2ec3ebccbdb8a1355344fde6f6ccb47f4efaded591e2aee8e", "ja": "え、えへへ♪　これはロコとコノミの合作です！\nどんなムービーになるか、今から楽しみですね♪", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿♪这是ROCO和木实合作完成的作品！\n真期待它会变成什么样的影片啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0304_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6eb139c32e11fc80f25f5f1bfc0113c44ebeff6664fcada95c73ac5f5e3adc86", "ja": "（PVが公開されると、ロコの演技や表情が大好評！\nこのみさんとロコの化学反応が、実を結んだな！）", "zh": "（PV公开后，ROCO的演技和表情大受好评！\n看来这次美奈子的_ROCO化学反应，终于开花结果了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
